sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    box rgb(225,245,238) MC team 
        participant SFMC as SFMC
    end
    box rgb(250,236,231) AWS team 
        participant S3 as Amazon S3
        participant L as Lambda
    end
    box rgb(238,237,254) SAS team
        participant MD as SAS MD runtime
    end

    Note over SFMC,MD: 1. Outbound --> SAS MD : get decisions 
    SFMC->>S3: Audience file (customer_id, channel_id)<br/>SQL -> DE Extract -> File Convert UTF-8 -> File Transfer
    S3->>L: S3 event trigger
    L->>MD: Event request "SF Best journey request"<br/>(customer_id, channel_id)
    Note right of MD: Lookup Customer_Profile<br/>Run "SF Journey Decisions"<br/>Write decision_contact_history
    MD-->>L: NBA grid + responseTrackingCode per customer
    L->>S3: Decision result file<br/>(customer_id, responseTrackingCode, action_code)
    S3->>SFMC: Import file into DE
    Note over SFMC: Journey -> send messages

    Note over SFMC,MD: 2. Return to SFMC <-- contact and response
    SFMC->>S3: Sent / Open / Click file<br/>(joined on responseTrackingCode)
    S3->>L: S3 event trigger
    L->>MD: Subject Contact API<br/>/markAsContacts (Sent), /responses (Open/Click)
    Note right of MD: presented_contact_history<br/>response_history
